# Input

```scss
@mixin relay { @content; }
@mixin frames {@include relay {0%{/* start */opacity:0}100%{opacity:1}}}
@include unknown { 0%,50% {opacity:0.5} 100% {opacity:1} }
.after {color:red}

```


# Formatted

```scss
@mixin relay {
	@content;
}
@mixin frames {
	@include relay {
		0% {
			/* start */ opacity: 0;
		}
		100% {
			opacity: 1;
		}
	}
}
@include unknown {
	0%,
	50% {
		opacity: 0.5;
	}
	100% {
		opacity: 1;
	}
}
.after {
	color: red;
}

```
